  "topPRs": [
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABAeABUA",
      "title": "sepolia-devnet-3: add chain config",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1311,
      "body": "## Summary\n- Add sepolia-devnet-3 from devnets-private to the registry\n- Add chain config, superchain config, compressed genesis, addresses, chainList, and CHAINS entry\n- Public RPC verified at https://sepolia-devnet-3.optimism.io/rpc with eth_chainId `0x190aace2` (420130018)\n- Per the devnet manifest, sepolia-devnet-3 is a permissioned Kona staging chain sharing the sepolia-devnet-2 superchain deployment (same `SuperchainConfigProxy` `0x289d2A1b1AE6E0470D8B72E53B6E3f485f251DBb` and OPCM `0xe5dF58eAf094F1FdA718c62dF709b81c41f80491`); like sepolia-devnet-2 it is registered as its own superchain target\n\n## Import details\n- Source: `devnets-private/stg/sepolia-devnet-3/op-deployer/state.json`\n- Imported with `ops/cmd/import_devnet` + `ops/cmd/sync_staging` using the op-deployer `v0.7.1` release binary (matches the state file's `opDeployerVersion` `0.7.1-75254822-2026-05-27T13:58:19Z`)\n- The staged `superchain.toml` was written by hand: `import_devnet`'s superchain-definition step fails on v0.7.x state files because `ReadOpcmImpl` doesn't know the `implementationsDeployment.OpcmV2Impl` key; the values are taken directly from the state file's `superchainContracts` / `implementationsDeployment`\n- Genesis and rollup values cross-checked against `devnets-private/stg/sepolia-devnet-3/sepolia-devnet-3/rollup.json`, and the live network's genesis block hash (`eth_getBlockByNumber 0x0`) matches `genesis.l2.hash` (`0xaab365bf4b86a69dcec883fdd462a8d8eccd7947e1fcb8a25b67be1e82bdbf79`)\n\n## Validation\n- `just check-chainlist`\n- `just check-genesis-integrity`\n- `cd ops && go run ./cmd/check_depsets/main.go`\n- `go test ./...` in `ops` and `validation` with `SEPOLIA_RPC_URL`/`MAINNET_RPC_URL`/`DEPLOYER_CACHE_DIR` set (plain `go test` because the gotestsum version pinned in the justfile does not build on go 1.26)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-20T20:39:55Z",
